  "description": "Contradiction schematic, not feasible Euclidean full lines: parallel horizontal solid portions a/b/c and separately angled dashed continuations crossing at P. Turns and solid/dash distinctions are source facts. Assertions check only depicted strokes. The hypothesis of two parallels meeting at P remains unexecuted and blocks promotion (semantic HOLD).",
